# `[gfxhub] page fault` for the repro run, captured again after a host reboot (2026-09-14 21:51)

The host was rebooted (uptime 0 at ~21:45) to rule out corrupted machine state (ROCm/MIOpen
caches, driver state). `repro_real.py --only original --repeats 2` then launched the packaged
config on the packaged dataset in run `01_original-1`, and the fault fired again at step 101 of
120, ~2:40 into the run, in the same Tensile kernel and with the same status class as
`fault-dmesg.log`:

```
[  376.473161] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0: [gfxhub] page fault (src_id:0 ring:157 vmid:8 pasid:69)
[  376.473166] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:  Process python pid 4484 thread python pid 4484
[  376.473168] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:   in page starting at address 0x00007f89f5e00000 from client 10
[  376.473169] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0: GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS:0x0080113B
[  376.473170] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     Faulty UTCL2 client ID: TCP (0x8)
[  376.473171] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     MORE_FAULTS: 0x1
[  376.473172] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     WALKER_ERROR: 0x5
[  376.473173] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     PERMISSION_FAULTS: 0x3
[  376.473173] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     MAPPING_ERROR: 0x1
[  376.473174] amdgpu 0000:03:00.0:     RW: 0x0
```

Child side (`/tmp/axl-fix2-repro/01_original-1/train.out`), same kernel as `fault-child.log`:

```
epoch=51/60 step=101 loss=0.0371:  84%|████████▍ | 101/120 [02:05<00:21,  1.12s/it]Warning: Queue error - HSA_STATUS_ERROR_MEMORY_FAULT
Memory Fault Error [host: acitehost, GPU index: 0, faulting addr: 0x7f89f5e00000, kernel: Cijk_Ailk_Bjlk_BBS_BH_Bias_HA_S_SAV_UserArgs_MT32x32x128_MI16x16x1_SN_..._ISA1201_..._WGMXCC1]
Memory access fault by GPU node-1 (Agent handle: 0x558984b452e0) on address 0x7f89f5e00000. Reason: Page not present or supervisor privilege.
```

Faulting address is 2 MiB aligned again (`0x7f89f5e00000`), one read/write class away from the
`0x0090113B` status in `fault-dmesg.log` (`0x0080113B` here, `MAPPING_ERROR` and `WALKER_ERROR`
set in both). Conclusion: the abort is a property of this config reaching step 101 on this driver,
not of accumulated machine state — a clean boot reproduces it.
